{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"us-roth-conversion UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"nl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"us-roth-conversion.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["us-roth-conversion.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"nl","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Alle tarieven zijn schattingen die u invoert. Deze calculator bepaalt niet de belastbare basis, pro-rata behandeling, belastingklassen, staatsbelasting, vervroegde opname boetes, Medicare effecten of in aanmerking komen. Belasting betaald buiten de IRA heeft een opportuniteitskosten die niet is opgenomen in het weergegeven rekeningsaldo.","record_id":"4cd4a959ae81af426b5e709514929615df7a96459cf9265cf7c2c6bb02db4079","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.791695282625028,"source":"All rates are estimates you enter. This calculator does not determine taxable basis, pro-rata treatment, tax brackets, state tax, early-withdrawal penalties, Medicare effects or eligibility. Tax paid outside the IRA has an opportunity cost that is not included in the displayed account balance. Confirm current tax rules with the IRS or a qualified tax professional.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"5a34ee6a52ad76537798e0c9bbc8c3facd440522b9e1934e79ff5ff09736b85f","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Alle tarieven zijn schattingen die u invoert. Deze calculator bepaalt niet de belastbare basis, pro-rata behandeling, belastingklassen, staatsbelasting, vervroegde opname boetes, Medicare effecten of in aanmerking komen. Belasting betaald buiten de IRA heeft een opportuniteitskosten die niet is opgenomen in het weergegeven rekeningsaldo.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
